  - m_Id: 955685455806464
    m_Localized: Bloodletter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 955685455806465
    m_Localized: Hitting an enemy at max bleed stacks heals you a little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 955685455806466
    m_Localized: Frenzy Edge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 955685455806467
    m_Localized: Each combo step is faster than the last; a dash attack resets it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 956977888641024
    m_Localized: Hook Barbs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 957219535077376
    m_Localized: Chain Hook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 957219535077377
    m_Localized: Drag to maw also pulls in a second barbed enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 957219535077378
    m_Localized: Feeding Line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 957219535077379
    m_Localized: Dragging an enemy in restores ability charge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 958398340022272
    m_Localized: Acid Spitter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 958669547913216
    m_Localized: Melting Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 958669547913217
    m_Localized: Your acid strips enemy armor three times as fast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 958669547913218
    m_Localized: Acid Bath
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 958669547913219
    m_Localized: Standing in your own acid pool boosts attack speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 959780384161792
    m_Localized: Arc Tendrils
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 960177463115776
    m_Localized: Overload Chain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 960177471504384
    m_Localized: Chain lightning adds static to the enemies it hits, enabling cascades.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 960177471504385
    m_Localized: Conductive Field
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 960177471504386
    m_Localized: Storm field also locks machines in place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 961148855533568
    m_Localized: Flame Gland
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 961409678327808
    m_Localized: Scorched Earth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 961409678327809
    m_Localized: Flame bursts leave burning ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 961409678327810
    m_Localized: Cauterize
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 961409678327811
    m_Localized: Burning enemies take extra stagger damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 962321377411072
    m_Localized: Rail Spine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 962557311205376
    m_Localized: Pinning Spines
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 962557311205377
    m_Localized: Sniper shots pin enemies in place briefly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 962557311205378
    m_Localized: Endless Ricochet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 962557311205379
    m_Localized: Ricochet bounces one extra time for each enemy it kills.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 964165914869760
    m_Localized: Shatterpoint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 964165956812800
    m_Localized: Stagger breaks stun 1 s longer, and stunned enemies take 30% more damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 964391157383168
    m_Localized: Crushing Coils
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 964391165771776
    m_Localized: Your attacks build stagger 40% faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 964614206275584
    m_Localized: Concussive Slam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 964614214664192
    m_Localized: Breaking an enemy's stagger releases a shockwave that staggers everything around it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 964838609928192
    m_Localized: Aftershock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 964838622511104
    m_Localized: A heavy attack on a staggered enemy extends its stun by 1 s, once per stun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 965065135898624
    m_Localized: Hemorrhage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 965065148481536
    m_Localized: Breaking an enemy's stagger bursts all of its bleed stacks at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 965289392750592
    m_Localized: Melting Point
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 965289401139200
    m_Localized: Corroded enemies build stagger 50% faster, and breaking one splashes acid on those nearby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 965508255727616
    m_Localized: Barbed Hide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 965508264116224
    m_Localized: Enemies that strike you in melee take damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 965729157136384
    m_Localized: While armored during a consume, damage you take is reflected at the attacker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 965949551034368
    m_Localized: Quill Burst
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 965949563617280
    m_Localized: Taking damage releases a ring of spines around you. Short cooldown.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966170255310848
    m_Localized: Jagged Recoil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966170259505152
    m_Localized: Thorns damage also builds stagger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 970431999524864
    m_Localized: Rending Edges
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 970432045662208
    m_Localized: Combo step 1 and step 2 hits apply a stack of bleed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 970668348555264
    m_Localized: Bleed stacks 2 higher and ticks 30% faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 970911647547392
    m_Localized: Spines apply bleed stacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 971146608263168
    m_Localized: Sanguine Feast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 971146612457472
    m_Localized: Consuming a bleeding enemy heals an extra 2% of your health per bleed stack on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 971389533962240
    m_Localized: Hungry Grasp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 971389542350848
    m_Localized: Elites and armored enemies can be grabbed below 35% health, plus 5% per size stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 971631717269504
    m_Localized: Long Reach
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 971631725658112
    m_Localized: Grab enemies from 50% further away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 971864958320640
    m_Localized: Desperate Hunger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 971864970903552
    m_Localized: While below 30% health, enemies can be grabbed at 10% more health.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 972100820811776
    m_Localized: Faltering Prey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 972100829200384
    m_Localized: Enemies that drop low enough to grab are stunned for 1 s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 972337350197248
    m_Localized: Dissolving Grip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 972337362780160
    m_Localized: Corroded enemies can be grabbed below 40% health.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 972575326617600
    m_Localized: Ravenous Maw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 972575339200512
    m_Localized: Consuming heals 25% more, and the bonus doubles while below 30% health.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 972811931500544
    m_Localized: Leech Tendrils
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 972811948277760
    m_Localized: Every attack hit heals a tiny amount.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 973948617244672
    m_Localized: Consume healing past full health becomes a shield that decays over 4 s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 973948625633280
    m_Localized: Marrow Store
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 977600526434304
    m_Localized: Static Skin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 977600568377344
    m_Localized: Dashing through enemies shocks them and builds static.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 977820408627200
    m_Localized: Arc Conductor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 977820421210112
    m_Localized: Electric hits build static 50% faster, and chain lightning jumps to 2 more targets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978038202056704
    m_Localized: Bio-electric damage deals double stagger to machines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978257710956544
    m_Localized: Grounding Spike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978257719345152
    m_Localized: Charged heavies instantly release all static on the target as chain lightning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978477953859584
    m_Localized: Capacitor Organ
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978477962248192
    m_Localized: Charge fills 30% faster, and electric hits fill extra charge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
