    m_Localized: Brood Implant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 982869339815936
    m_Localized: Attacks implant parasites. Infected enemies burst on death, damaging and infecting those nearby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 983102849302528
    m_Localized: Puppet Spores
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 983102857691136
    m_Localized: Infected enemies below 30% health are briefly taken over and lash out at their allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
